The MIT license in this repository applies to Family Radio project material.

Development and operation use separately installed tools and libraries. These
include Python, FFmpeg, mpv, the Linux networking tools, Arduino CLI, the ESP32
Arduino core, M5GFX, M5Unified, M5Dial, Node.js, Playwright, Chromium, Pillow,
ZXing-C++, Blender and OrcaSlicer. Each is distributed under its own terms.
Consult the upstream notices when redistributing a compiled firmware image,
toolchain or runtime package.

Spotify playback requires a separate service account and authorization.
Supply music that you have permission to use.
